BAR Droid phone version of BAR's Unit Groups (luaui/widgets/gui_unitgroups.lua): not drawn and taking no presses while
the app's touch dock is up (WG.BarDroidPortrait.active()), whose groups strip shows the groups. BAR places this box
right of the order menu's reported place and reads it only when the screen resizes; under the dock it lay hidden, but
on the unfolded Fold7 sideways about 20 pixels of it (its empty "1-9") showed at the split dock's right block whenever
the dock's groups strip was hidden (pregame; nothing picked, no groups, no idle builders; dev phone at 1080x1198,
2026-11-15). With the pad, BAR's own screen back (the dock not active), the box draws as before. Applied by the engine
(BarDroidPhoneLuaDir) to BAR's file as LuaUI loads it; if a block finds no place, BAR's own file runs. Both places
are the same in every BAR release on the dev phone, test-31465 to test-31958.

@@@ find
function widget:DrawScreen()
	gl.Blending(GL_SRC_ALPHA, GL_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA)
	if not spec or showWhenSpec then
@@@ with
function widget:DrawScreen()
	-- BAR Droid (phone): the touch dock up, its groups strip has the groups
	if WG.BarDroidPortrait and WG.BarDroidPortrait.active and WG.BarDroidPortrait.active() then
		return
	end
	gl.Blending(GL_SRC_ALPHA, GL_ONE_MINUS_SRC_ALPHA)
	if not spec or showWhenSpec then
@@@ end

@@@ find
function widget:MousePress(x, y, button)
	if Spring.IsGUIHidden() then
		return
	end
@@@ with
function widget:MousePress(x, y, button)
	if Spring.IsGUIHidden() then
		return
	end
	-- BAR Droid (phone): not drawn while the touch dock is up, so no presses either
	if WG.BarDroidPortrait and WG.BarDroidPortrait.active and WG.BarDroidPortrait.active() then
		return
	end
@@@ end

@@@ find
function widget:Update(dt)
	if not (not spec or showWhenSpec) then
		return
	end
@@@ with
function widget:Update(dt)
	if not (not spec or showWhenSpec) then
		return
	end
	-- BAR Droid (phone): not drawn while the touch dock is up, so no hover, tooltip or cursor either: its box's last place
	-- (sideways with the pad, before the dock came back) showed "Unit Groups" over the map (review 2026-11-16)
	if WG.BarDroidPortrait and WG.BarDroidPortrait.active and WG.BarDroidPortrait.active() then
		return
	end
@@@ end
